message: "If you use this standard or its reference implementation, please cite it as below."
title: "MRFS: Marketplace Ranking Fairness Standard"
authors:
  - family-names: "Chandra"
    given-names: "Ieshika"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-23"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ieshika/mrfs-standard"
abstract: "MRFS is a deployable audit standard for measuring exposure and outcome fairness in marketplace ranking systems, translating academic fair-ranking research (NIST TREC Fair Ranking Track, AWRF) and NIST's AI Risk Management Framework into a concrete metric catalog, audit protocol, and governance process for commercial marketplaces."
keywords:
  - algorithmic fairness
  - marketplace ranking
  - audit protocol
  - AI governance
  - exposure fairness
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22073259
